  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AEI critical organisational support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AEI is currently implementing two programmes in the West Bank with CAFOD funding:  an Early Warning Response System which aims to protect vulnerable residents by promoting civic peace at community level (PAL061); and a project which explores the role of the environment in peacebuilding initiatives whilst promoting a culture of encounter between young people from different faiths and communities (PAL058).  This project will support all of AEI&apos;s work by strengthening their organisational capacity, particularly in the areas of data collection and analysis (upgrade to office IT equipment); communication (mobile phones, projector and portable sound system for events) and operational capacity (support for staff salaries and training).  5 members of AEI&apos;s network organisations will be invited to join the training activities.</narrative>
  </description>
